flowchart TD
    A([Administrator wants organizational change])
    --> B{Change type}

    B -->|Create| C[Enter new master data]
    B -->|Update| D[Edit existing master data]
    B -->|Deactivate| E[Select record to deactivate]

    C --> F[Specify Effective Date]
    D --> F
    E --> F

    F --> G{Effective Date >=<br/>end of current business day?}

    G -->|No| H[Reject change]

    H --> F

    G -->|Yes| I[Schedule organizational change]

    I --> J[Current configuration remains active]

    J --> K{Effective Date reached?}

    K -->|No| J

    K -->|Yes| L[New organizational state becomes effective]

    L --> M[Previous state retained as history]

    M --> N([Change completed])